    "background_story": "Cookie was a free-spirited teenager who lived for the thrill of the ride. She discovered her passion for rollerblading at the age of 12 and quickly became a local legend on wheels. With her bright pink hair and infectious grin, Cookie would speed down the boardwalk, weaving in and out of pedestrians with ease. She joined a rollerblading crew and together they performed daring tricks and stunts, drawing crowds and cheers wherever they went. As she honed her skills, Cookie began competing in local and national competitions, earning a reputation as a fearless and agile rollerblader. Her love for the sport took her on adventures across the country, but no matter where she went, Cookie always remained true to her roots and her rollerblading community.",
